{
  "id": "nce2-l87",
  "title": "Lesson 87: A Perfect Alibi",
  "audio": "/audio/nce2/87－A Perfect Alibi.mp3",
  "image": "/images/nce2/l87/scene1.jpg",
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "intro_1",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "What was wrong with the man's story?",
      "translation": "这个人的说法有什么问题？",
      "startTime": 11.31,
      "endTime": 16.12,
      "analysis": {
        "words": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "intro_2",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "'At the time the murder was committed, I was travelling on the 8 o'clock train to London,' said the man.",
      "translation": "'谋杀发生时，我正乘8点钟的火车去伦敦，'那人说。",
      "startTime": 16.13,
      "endTime": 25.95,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "Alibi",
            "pos": "n.",
            "meaning": "不在场证明"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "intro_3",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "'Do you always catch such an early train?' asked the inspector.",
      "translation": "'你总是赶这么早的火车吗？'探长问。",
      "startTime": 25.96,
      "endTime": 31.7,
      "analysis": {
        "words": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "intro_4",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "'Of course I do,' answered the man.",
      "translation": "'当然是的，'那人回答。",
      "startTime": 31.71,
      "endTime": 35.85,
      "analysis": {
        "words": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "'I must be at work at 10 o'clock.",
      "translation": "'我必须10点钟上班。",
      "startTime": 35.86,
      "endTime": 38.99,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "Inspector",
            "pos": "n.",
            "meaning": "探长"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "My employer will confirm that I was there on time.'",
      "translation": "我的雇主会证实我准时到达。'",
      "startTime": 39,
      "endTime": 44.68,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "Suspicious",
            "pos": "adj.",
            "meaning": "怀疑的"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "'Would a later train get you to work on time?' asked the inspector.",
      "translation": "'晚一点的火车能让你准时上班吗？'探长问。",
      "startTime": 44.69,
      "endTime": 51.07,
      "analysis": {
        "words": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s4",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "'I suppose it would, but I never catch a later train.'",
      "translation": "'我想可以，但我从不乘晚一点的火车。'",
      "startTime": 51.08,
      "endTime": 57.14,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "Murder",
            "pos": "v.",
            "meaning": "谋杀"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s5",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "'At what time did you arrive at the station?'",
      "translation": "'你什么时候到车站的？'",
      "startTime": 57.15,
      "endTime": 62.04,
      "analysis": {
        "words": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s6",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "'At ten to eight. I bought a paper and waited for the train.'",
      "translation": "'7点50分。我买了一份报纸，等着火车。'",
      "startTime": 62.05,
      "endTime": 68.07,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "Impossible",
            "pos": "adj.",
            "meaning": "不可能的"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s7",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "'And you didn't notice anything unusual?'",
      "translation": "'你没有注意到什么不寻常的事情吗？'",
      "startTime": 68.08,
      "endTime": 73.12,
      "analysis": {
        "words": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s8",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "'Of course not.'",
      "translation": "'当然没有。'",
      "startTime": 73.13,
      "endTime": 75.67,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "Ignorant",
            "pos": "adj.",
            "meaning": "无知的"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s9",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "'I suggest,' said the inspector,' that you are not telling the truth.",
      "translation": "'我认为，'探长说，'你没有说实话。",
      "startTime": 75.68,
      "endTime": 82.97,
      "analysis": {
        "words": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s10",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "I suggest that you did not catch the 8 o'clock train,",
      "translation": "我认为你没有赶上8点钟的火车，",
      "startTime": 82.98,
      "endTime": 87.83,
      "analysis": {
        "words": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s11",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "but that you caught the 8.25 which would still get you to work on time.",
      "translation": "而是赶上了8点25分的火车，这仍然可以让你准时上班。",
      "startTime": 87.84,
      "endTime": 94.86,
      "analysis": {
        "words": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s12",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "You see, on the morning of the murder, the 8 o'clock train did not run at all.",
      "translation": "你看，在案发那天早上，8点钟的火车根本没有开。",
      "startTime": 94.87,
      "endTime": 102.65,
      "analysis": {
        "words": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s13",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "It broke down at Ferngreen station and was taken off the line.'",
      "translation": "它在芬格林站坏了，被撤出了运行。'",
      "startTime": 102.66,
      "endTime": 107.66,
      "analysis": {
        "words": []
      }
    }
  ]
}